    {
      "id": "yuan-065",
      "baseContent": "九殿春风鳷鹊楼，千里离宫龙凤舟。始为天下忧，后为天下羞。",
      "baseAuthor": "徐再思",
      "translation": "春风轻拂九殿旁的鳷鹊楼，千里之外的行宫龙舟游。起初他为天下事忧心忡忡，后来却让天下人为他蒙羞。",
      "notes": [
        {
          "term": "鳷鹊楼",
          "meaning": "汉武帝时建宫观名，在长安甘泉宫外。"
        },
        {
          "term": "离宫",
          "meaning": "天子出巡时休憩的行宫。"
        }
      ],
      "tags": [],
      "source": {
        "url": "https://www.gushiwenku.cn/shiwen/6aebb41/",
        "sha256": "d822b1829e801afa4a0c33ae3e927f47c49b631ecbccf48849d08a6799ba9bee",
        "fetchedAt": "2026-11-04T16:40:53.595876+00:00",
        "cacheFile": "expansion/gushiwenku-crawler-v1.0.1/cache/d822b1829e801afa4a0c33ae3e927f47c49b631ecbccf48849d08a6799ba9bee.html",
        "sourceTitle": "凭栏人·咏史"
      },
      "editorialStatus": "source_imported_pending_review",
